   "notes": [
    "a member whose certificate was revoked and re-issued (same controller) before anyone evicted keeps the seat: the room checks the certificate now, not its history",
    "a consumer that does not pin POF (hostile naive_gate) asked the FAKE POF about a random subject: it answered yes, tier 5. pof_gate pins POF (Program<Pof>) and is not exposed; integrators must pin it too",
